# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

This resource allows you to create and configure a request schema in ConductorOne.
String fields must configure exactly one view: `text_field`, `password_field`,
`select_field`, `picker_field`, or `date_field`. A plain input can use
`text_field = { multiline = false }`.

Nested `fields[].name` values are computed from the display labels. Remove these
assignments when upgrading; keep the top-level resource `name`. Existing state
and imports retain their resource IDs, without replacement or state removal.

